<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Madness</h1>
<p>Sphere: Poison Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Necromancer (guild level 7)
Mana: 15
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast madness &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast madness</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>Gives a humanoid or mammal a brain fever: a battle with their own mind 
begins. For about half an hour, every half minute they do something mad: 
sing, cry, drop their money or leave gold for the poor, run screaming from a 
corpse that isn't there, cast spells for no reason, try to write a poem. As 
the madness grows, it turns violent, and they may attack anyone near them, 
sure they've been betrayed. Asleep, they only have nightmares.
</p><p>Remove disease, or dispel magic, cures it if strong enough. The target 
resists the spell with their mind; either way, casting it starts a fight. It 
is also found on potions, wands, scrolls and staffs.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Remove Disease</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Plague</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Poison Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>